  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nMy Document embeds an iframe and I want to ensure that the first frame rendered by this Document blocks on the iframe being ready to render.\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\nThe [blocking](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/urls-and-fetching.html#blocking-attributes) attribute enables authors to block rendering of a Document on scripts, stylesheets and parsing of specific elements.\n\nUsing this, an author can block rendering on an iframe element being _parsed_ but not on the iframe's Document being fetched and the embedded Document also getting render-unblocked.\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\nThe render-blocking concept could be extended to allow inheritance into iframes.\n\n### Anything else?\n\n_No response_",
